{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0353_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "4a1ba91d6f78e2e91a2c51644c6fbdb02041543acd644ed73d00910e5ff8aff5", "ja": "それぞれの関係性", "zh": "各自的关系", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0353_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "85e06a1a3f9e14b644e6c2fbf511d16a088e959f2244fa0fad4a37439cb471bd", "ja": "ドラマ撮影当日、クロエが出演しない事を\n聞いて驚く真珠星。なるは、クロエにもっと\n頼ってほしいという胸の内を真珠星と藍に\n話す。藍は「クロエにはまわりくどく言った\nって通じない」と、なるに助言する。", "zh": "电视剧拍摄当天，真珠星听说克洛伊不出演，感到十分惊讶。なる向真珠星和藍诉说了自己希望克洛伊能更多依赖自己的心情。藍劝なる说：“对克洛伊拐弯抹角地说是行不通的。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0353_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_05_1000_null", "source_sha256": "2982abe4d4c3854494301c250ddd56d42a37d78e29644c7ef398fad2116db8b3", "ja": "学園ドラマ　撮影当日……", "zh": "校园剧　拍摄当天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0353_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_05_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b3c8700f0e328be920880301e54b0c01d2c438a4f4892a9c51b69d5456c393be", "ja": "……あれ？\nクロエさんが見当たらない……？", "zh": "……咦？\n找不到克洛伊小姐……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0353_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_05_1002_035hin", "source_sha256": "90fa3274ede3640e9fafabd741892519ea1f04f9f57acfb2cbaf18b307cd0521", "ja": "クロエさんなら、来ないよ？\n今日撮影する話には、出番がないから。", "zh": "克洛伊的话，不会来的哦？\n因为今天拍摄的内容里没有她的戏份。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0353_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_05_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "5c93594231fac92e4fc782d51d47ba60692b20c9e002c86573a9f1e4c32fa373", "ja": "そうね。\n毎回出演はしないって、本人の希望だし。", "zh": "是啊。\n毕竟不可能每次都出演，这也是她本人的意愿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0353_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_05_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4991f4e676809bf2a727209a2afcf9248b326730ec9933f25d585f0dfffa3ae7", "ja": "え？\n……待って、仕事って断れるの！？", "zh": "诶？\n……等等，工作是可以拒绝的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0353_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_05_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "1b17ae5223b05e30d4ee617bf091b5491bea5dbc07bd0fbff4f2237c4443f874", "ja": "うん。それは、まあ。\nあくまで本人の意志だから……。", "zh": "嗯，这个嘛……算是吧。\n毕竟这终究还是本人的意愿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0353_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_05_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "a998822e58bc199a38c530d95e249c73dc6f6276d4a0752f2e6873586f559fe0", "ja": "なるの言うとおりよ。\n嫌なら、無理にやらせる事なんてできないでしょ。", "zh": "正如奈露所说。\n如果不愿意，就不能强迫她去做吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0353_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_05_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "cecdc413b13ead9fa1bef53ca22f4d881473bea6b4edbf707cb8b3ae338ca075", "ja": "そんな！\n私の時は、拒否権なんてなかったのに……！", "zh": "怎么会这样！\n我当时可没有拒绝的权利啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0353_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_05_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "7e3a67f3fd6c4ac680ea2a4bcfd2cd7c5a413652982635e83f3649521bec3f60", "ja": "アンタ、仕事いらないの？\nギャラ減るけど。", "zh": "你不要工作了吗？  \n报酬可是会减少的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0353_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_05_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b8ed373c250c9eba529a2a347942bc365e28da3c4e5a680f5ccfbbfac6882464", "ja": "ぐっ…………。\nやり、ます……！", "zh": "呜…………  \n我、做……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0353_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_05_1010_null", "source_sha256": "79c62dc1ae38d3909e193a2ff6f302a2c77692892f87af8a8791891bfe4a95ed", "ja": "撮影終了後……", "zh": "拍摄结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0353_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_05_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0887d1476bb73e2a5f684cf602f7f9cb245320f6b904ef9892e27ba30f1195b3", "ja": "ねえ、なるちゃん。クロエさんって、\n空いた時間で何してるの？", "zh": "那个，小鸣。克洛伊小姐空闲时间都在做些什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0353_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_05_1012_035hin", "source_sha256": "7c05cda3cc5762bd52bec3929828d32d426c27be854c25417713c5ad9e454290", "ja": "うーん……ダンス、かな？\n自主練してるところは、よく見かけるよ。", "zh": "嗯……跳舞吧？\n我经常看到她在自主练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0353_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_05_1013_035hin", "source_sha256": "298c6411679e1331164a7268d2153d022fc47e1799a8f98dc1d3f0d64d865f90", "ja": "でも、それ以外のクロエさんが何をしてるのか、\n私もよく知らないんだ。", "zh": "不过，克洛伊小姐在那之外都在做些什么，我也不太清楚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0353_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_05_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "fa4fe782385bcd0d048b63959e82716d5a855a1810d0bcd3037d488a0c9cea7f", "ja": "そっかぁ……。", "zh": "这样啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0353_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_05_1015_035hin", "source_sha256": "a95a1d0f37c38c6db784b0f908ad1924c15e641a0400c4705c10e5130f397e4f", "ja": "『Vermilion Red』の相方なのにね。私も、\nもうすこし話ができたらって思うんだけど……。", "zh": "明明是《Vermilion Red》的搭档呢。我也在想，\n要是能多和她聊聊就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0353_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_05_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "d467e98ea701e7aaa67a5e4a977c6b7e545e692614a253baed4b4ee6178a83aa", "ja": "バラエティやトークが苦手なら、私が回すし。\nすこしくらい、頼ってほしいなぁって……。", "zh": "如果你不擅长综艺和聊天的话，就由我来活跃气氛。也希望你能稍微依靠我一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0353_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_05_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "99aba88d5faed0055d4cd91e4517ebf17c29929cf48965c0496f9a56de9cc2a6", "ja": "……。\n同じデュオでも、色々あるんだね。", "zh": "……\n就算同样是双人组合，情况也各不相同呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0353_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_05_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "dd52f91a9d13b0d6e2bf459e2357a810e6c0d588698f2dc5b398884b6cbc6a98", "ja": "（私と藍さんは、遠慮なく物が言える。\n……それって、実は結構いいことなのかな？）", "zh": "（我和蓝小姐可以毫不顾忌地直说。\n……其实，这算是件挺不错的事吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0353_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_05_1019_035hin", "source_sha256": "d5361475a92f1f0dcf4ac37be1fe765823c6d5c9599efa1cee4e12a2cfbe5d75", "ja": "？　真珠星ちゃん、どうかした？", "zh": "？　真珠星，你怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0353_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_05_1020_016tsu", "source_sha256": "bd97e0edccad2a9d9e8e51a2b01346d1c5c57153a2f71c416a27f58f5edec65f", "ja": "な、なんでもない！", "zh": "没、没什么！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0353_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_05_1021_043nor", "source_sha256": "68e7aa4c5b0ada69e507f02db218850fc596d5ebad44fec791e65863a6ccd676", "ja": "それ、直接言えばいいんじゃない？\nクロエは、気にしないと思うけど。", "zh": "那直接说出来不就好了吗？\n我觉得克洛伊应该不会在意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0353_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_05_1022_035hin", "source_sha256": "9f369182da75a6f3ea9773e52e3fae2db69fbd4f60a3862964a1b755834fa228", "ja": "そうですか……？", "zh": "是这样吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0353_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_05_1023_043nor", "source_sha256": "8258ca48cd82119347301182306b283ce9c2fa4c723083deab3f10f50f57ad48", "ja": "だって、向こうがそういうスタイルなんだもの。\n私のことも、『変なやつ』とか言うし。", "zh": "因为对方就是那种作风嘛。\n还说我是“怪人”什么的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0353_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_05_1024_043nor", "source_sha256": "2dd3bea2057b7f8a71c1a1daedec76434bbcf7cba3242d365e35f7bcff83978c", "ja": "アンタの方がよっぽど変人でしょって\n言ったら、ビックリしてたわよ。", "zh": "我说“明明是你更像怪人吧”，结果她吓了一跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0353_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_05_1025_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4e8b063b1e2eb03ffa18699961a7dfd604f3ad81b6504ad332c0cdcef1892bb1", "ja": "そういうの、\n本人にストレートに言うことある！？", "zh": "这种话，你有直接对本人说过吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0353_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_05_1026_035hin", "source_sha256": "efc4bb8712491474b48dc0f7b05b02b763a88c035de8ae1f4ff80563ded0614a", "ja": "あの……\nケンカになったりとかは……？", "zh": "那个……\n没演变成吵架之类的吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0353_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_05_1027_043nor", "source_sha256": "ad27c1884272e2a370095b5f6de60ade19559a698ef3f9f28383b4cbcefb7948", "ja": "全然？　あいつは驚いてたけど。\nそういえば、初めて言われたって言ってたかも。", "zh": "完全没有？虽然那家伙被吓了一跳。  \n这么说来，她好像还说这是第一次有人这么对她说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0353_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_05_1028_043nor", "source_sha256": "2e3bd70cd416862239067225f4640d07886100acc9b4893edeb2754c384a1d54", "ja": "クロエには、言いたいことははっきり言わないと。\nまわりくどく言ったって、通じないわ。", "zh": "对克洛艾，有什么想说的就得直截了当地说。\n拐弯抹角地说，她是听不懂的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0353_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_05_1029_035hin", "source_sha256": "c3c32d34fc5def71e73da60f4fe9b11d2e057f7b075ccfb99d6fc3e631b9f64b", "ja": "あー……。\nでもちょっと納得、かもです……。", "zh": "啊……  \n不过，好像也有点能理解了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0353_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_05_1030_043nor", "source_sha256": "ca53596b6184ef6e56851ba11b01241e5de07491b8948eafbdd379e8f0fe1f7b", "ja": "そのあとは、「勉強になった。他人から知ることが\nあるんだな」なんて言ってたし。大丈夫でしょ。", "zh": "之后还说了什么“真是学到东西了。原来还能从别人那里学到东西啊”之类的话。应该没事吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0353_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_05_1031_016tsu", "source_sha256": "fa2603d405d29e205cdb6384ad7366be6760a5144436bc5637db4e958b37c144", "ja": "……。\n藍さん、なんか慣れてない？", "zh": "……\n蓝小姐，怎么好像挺习惯的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0353_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_05_1032_043nor", "source_sha256": "6f49b0134f09cbf0a1e56c9f3d1d46ce44caef7e2e2132153b1be5b9bedd15f0", "ja": "誰かさんの姉にも、相当振り回されたからね。\n……じゃ、私は次の仕事があるから。", "zh": "我也被某人的姐姐折腾得够呛呢。……那我接下来还有工作，就先走了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0353_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_05_1033_035hin", "source_sha256": "a7c3ecd5fe7d806cdd611dcb5bb79445066c213656a7e3283cdfb781d4393e29", "ja": "あ、はい。\nお疲れさまです。", "zh": "啊，好的。\n辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0353_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_05_1034_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f3e61f958377080e82de93a8ce2aa98ddd7139edb066df238964d039667d774f", "ja": "誰かさんの姉……。\nあっ、織姫お姉ちゃんのこと！？", "zh": "某人的姐姐……啊，是说织姬姐姐吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
